journal~
The last entry, in a hand that shakes: "It came to the door today and asked
to pass. I said no, as I have said to all. It did not argue. It simply
waited, and I am so tired, and it is so patient. If you read this, I am
still at the door. Kill me if you can. I would like to rest."
